{
  "id": "MAT.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Mɛ̈T 13",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäätni kɛ kui̱ pi̱thä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ cu Yecu wä raar dueel, cuɛ wä nyuur gekä baar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bua̱n nath ti ŋuan wä kä jɛ. Kä cuɛ wä rɛy ria̱a̱y, kä cuɛ nyuur thi̱n, kä cu buɔ̱n kɛɛliw cuɔ̱ŋ wi̱i̱ po̱mä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu kɛ la̱t ŋɔaani ti ŋuan kɛ cäätni, wëë i̱, “Cu pi̱i̱th wä pi̱eth a kithɛ kuay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min pi̱thɛ cu tha̱a̱ŋ kuayni pɛn dup kä cu diit kɛ ben cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn pɛn guäth päämni mi thil mun mi di̱i̱t, cukɛ mal do̱ny kɛ ɣöö kuiy mundɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci cäŋ lɛ̈p cukɛ rɔɔl, kä cukɛ kööt, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ kɛ mɛy ti gɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn pɛn rɛy jiɛn kuiyni, kä mëë ci jiɛn piith, cua kɛ miɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn pɛn muun mi gɔaa, kä cukɛ tekɛ wuɔ̱th ti gɔw cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn rɔ̱ rep nikä kuɔ̱r, kä cu tin kɔ̱ŋ rɔ̱ rep nikɛ jiɛn bäkɛl, kä cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn rɔ̱ rep nikɛ jiɛn diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram mi tekɛ ji̱th a jɛ li̱ŋ!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luɔt cäätni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ ben thiëckɛ jɛ wäkɛ i̱, “Ɛŋu ruaci kɛ kɛ, kɛ cäätni mɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, “Cä mɛmɛ ka̱m yɛ ɛn ɣöö bia tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ni kuäärä nhial ŋa̱c, kä /ka̱n jɛ ka̱m kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ram mi tekɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r ba nyinkɛ rep, kä bikɛ ŋuan, kä ram mi thil ŋu ba mi tɔt mi tekɛ jɛ woc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn luɔt kä min ruacä kɛ kɛ, kɛ cäätni, ɛ ɣöö cäŋ gui̱ckɛ, /cikɛ nɛn, kä cäŋ li̱ŋkɛ, /cikɛ li̱ŋ, kä /cɛ cup lɔɔcdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ruac go̱kä ni I-ca-yaa a thuɔ̱k kä kɛ, mëë wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:14-15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ica 6:9-10.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lät Yecu ji̱ kɔaarɛ luɔt cäätdä pi̱thä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä inɔ, liɛŋɛ cäät pi̱i̱thä agɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ci raan ruac kuäärä Kuɔth liŋ, kä /kenɛ cop lɔɔcdɛ, bi gua̱n jiäkni ben, bɛ min ca piɛth lɔɔcdɛ ben pɛc. Mɔmɔ ce̱tdɛ kɛ kuay tin ca piɛth dup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ kä tin ca piɛth guäth päämni, ɛ jɛn ram min ci ruac liŋ, kä cɛ jɛ mal nhɔk kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn ram ɛmɔ ce̱tdɛ kɛ beel mi thil mɛy, kä bɛ li̱p thi̱n kɛ gua̱a̱th mi tɔt, kä mi bä ti bɛc bɛc kɛnɛ riɛk kɛ kui̱ ruac Kuɔth, niɛ guäth ɛmɔ bi ruac Kuɔth jiɛɛn kä jɛn ram ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ kä tin ca piɛth rɛy jiɛn kuiyni ce̱tkɛ kɛ ram mi liŋ ruac, kä miɛtkɛ ruac Kuɔth in tekɛ jɛ ɛ gör nyinä ɣɔaa kɛnɛ tɛth lɔaac riäŋä, kä thilɛ jɛ dɛy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ kä tin ca piɛth muun mi gɔaa, ce̱tkɛ kɛ ram mi liŋ ruac kä jekɛ jɛ kɛ lɔcdɛ, jɛn tëë kɛ dɛy ti gɔw kä kuiirɛ dɛy ti kuɔ̱r, kä kɛ gua̱a̱th in dɔ̱ŋ kuiirɛ dɛy ti jiɛn bäkɛl, kɛ gua̱a̱th in dɔ̱ŋ kuiirɛ dɛy ti jiɛn diɔ̱k.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäät juɔl rɛy bɛɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu kɛ la̱t ruac cäätdä dɔ̱diɛn wëë i̱, “Ce̱t ciaŋ kuäärä nhial kɛ ram mi ci kuay ti gɔw piɛth kakädɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä mëë te naath ni̱n, cu gua̱n tɛ̈rɛ ben, cuɛ jol ben piɛth rɛy bɛɛl, kä cuɛ jiɛɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ, mëë ci bɛl do̱ny a cikɛ jua̱k, cu jol päl bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy tin lät kɛ gua̱n ciëŋ ben, cukɛ jɛ thiec i̱, ‘Kuäär, /keni piɛth ni kuay ti gɔw rɛy kakädu? Kä jol ɛmɛ bëë nikä?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, ‘Ɛ gua̱n tɛ̈r ɛnɔ ci mɔmɔ la̱t ɔ.’ Kä cu ji̱ läätdä jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Go̱o̱ri jɛ ɛn ɣöö bakɔ wä bakɔ jol wä pur?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, ‘Ëëy, mi wiaa jol wä pur bia ciök bɛɛl pur kɛ kɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A kɛn diaal pith kɛɛl amäni gua̱a̱th ŋër. Kä mi wä gua̱a̱th ŋër cop, bä ji̱ ŋër jiök i̱, “Kɔanɛ ka̱m ni jol raar kä yianɛ jɛ tuɔthni, kɛ ɣöö ba jɛ waŋ, kä duɔlɛ bɛl luaakdä.” ’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäät kuaayä mi tɔt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ruac cäätdä dɔ̱diɛn la̱t kɛ, wëë i̱, “Ce̱t ciaŋ kuäärä nhial kɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈ mi tɔt mi ci raan ɛ ka̱n, kä cuɛ jɛ piɛth rɛy kakädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈ in kuiy ni jɛn kä kuay diaal, kä mëë cɛ piith, cu di̱t ni jɛn kä juaac diaal kä cua jiath, kɛ ɣöö bi diit duëlkiɛn la̱t nɔa̱a̱knikɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäät thopä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ lɛ la̱t cäät dɔ̱diɛn i̱, “Ce̱t ciaŋ kuäärä nhial kɛ thuɔp, mi ci ciek ɛ wac, kä liɔmɛ jɛ rɛy theemni nuɔ̱p da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, amäni mëë cɛ pua̱a̱r kɛɛliw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luɔt ruac Yecu kɛ cäätni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu ti̱ti̱ diaal la̱t naath kɛ cäätni, thilɛ mi lätdɛ kɛ a thil cäät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn nɛmɛ ɛ ɣöö bi mëë ca lar ɛ gök a thuɔ̱k i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:35",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 78:2.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lat Yecu kɛ luɔt cäätdä juɔl rɛy bɛɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu buɔ̱n ba̱ny piny, cuɛ wä dueel. Kä cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ ben kä jɛ, cukɛ wee i̱, “Lätni kɔ luɔt cäätdä juɔl rɛy kakä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, “Ram mi piith kuay ti gɔw ɛ jɛn Gat Ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kak ɛ jɛn ɣɔw, kä kuay ti gɔw kɛ kɛn gaat kuäärä nhial. Kä jol kɛ kɛn gaat gua̱n jiäkni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gua̱n tɛ̈r in ci jol pith ɛ jɛn gua̱n jiäkni. Kä gua̱a̱th ŋër ɛ jɛn guut ɣɔaa, kä ji̱ ŋër kɛ kɛn ja̱a̱k Kuɔth nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tkɛ min la jol a duɔlkɛ kä waŋkɛ jɛ kɛ mac, bɛ te inɔ guutdä ɣɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi Gat Ran ja̱a̱kɛ ja̱k, kä bikɛ ŋɔak diaal tin nööŋkɛ duer kuany raar cieŋ kuäärädɛ kɛnɛ la̱a̱t dueeri diaal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ba kɛ yuɔr maac. Ɛn wi̱ni bɛ tekɛ lul kɛnɛ muɔ̱th lɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ji̱ cuŋni ku buay ce̱tkɛ cäŋ rɛy kuäärä Gua̱ndiɛn in te nhial. Ram mi tekɛ ji̱th a jɛ li̱ŋ!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäät yio̱o̱ni ti ca tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ce̱t ciaŋ kuäärä nhial kɛ yio̱w ti ca tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ rɛy kakä. Kä mëë ci raan kɛ jek, cuɛ kɛ nyɔk kɛ mol piny, kä kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaacdɛ cuɛ wä wëë nyinkɛ diaal kɔak, kɛ ɣöö bɛ kak kɔk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäät dɔ̱a̱kni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ce̱t ciaŋ kuäärä nhial kɛ gua̱n ko̱kä mi go̱o̱r dɔ̱a̱kni ti wiɛc wiɛɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ dɔ̱k kɛl mi wi̱c wi̱c mi di̱t kökdɛ jek, cuɛ wä, cuɛ nyinkɛ diaal wä kɔak, kä cuɛ jɛ ben kɔk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäät cambakä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ce̱t ciaŋ kuäärä nhial kɛ cambak mi ca yuɔr yieer, kä kääpɛ rɛc diaal ti gööl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ thia̱a̱ŋ, cu naath ɛ yɔ̱a̱c thok waath, cukɛ nyuur liɛnykɛ rɛc tin gɔw rɛy diënyni, kä ya̱kɛ tin jiäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ te inɔ cäŋ guutdä ɣɔaa. Bi ja̱a̱k nhial ben, ba ji̱ dueeri ben da̱a̱k kɛnɛ ji̱ cuŋni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ba ji̱ dueeri yuɔr maac. Ɛn wi̱ni bɛ tekɛ lul kɛnɛ muɔ̱th lɛc.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thuɔ̱k mi pay tuɔɔk kɛnɛ mëë wal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yecu ji̱ kɔaarɛ thiec i̱, “Ci mɛmɛ kɛɛliw cop lɔcdun?” Cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Cɛ cop lɔɔcda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ce̱t gɔ̱ɔ̱r, min ca ŋi̱eec kɛ nyin kuäärä nhial kɛ gua̱n ciëŋ mi käm mi pay nööŋ kiɛ mi dɔaaŋ raar rɛy kuaknikɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱k Yecu kä Na-dha-rɛth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Yecu thuɔ̱k kɛ lat cäätni ti̱ti̱ cuɛ jiɛɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ben wi̱i̱diɛn, cuɛ naath tok kɛ ŋi̱i̱c guäth palädiɛn, kä cukɛ ga̱a̱c ɛlɔ̱ŋ, cukɛ wee i̱, “Ci wut ɛmɛ pɛl ɛmɛ kɛnɛ lät ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m ti̱ti̱ jek nikä? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ciɛ jɛn gat ŋäätdä jiɛn? Kä /ca man cɔl i̱ Mɛri? Kä dämani cikɛ Je-mɛth kɛnɛ Jo-thɛp, kɛ Thay-mɔn kɛnɛ Ju-däth? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ci nyimani diaal tekɛ kɔn kɛɛl? Kä ku wut ɛmɛ mɛmɛ lɛ jek nikä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn Yecu cu lo̱k. Kä cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Luɔ̱thkɛ gök gua̱thni diaal, ɛ ni wecdiɛn lökɛ jɛ thi̱n ɔ ɛ nɛɛkɛ pa̱ny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /kenɛ lät ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m ti ŋuan la̱t ɛn wi̱ni, kɛ kui̱ thil ŋäthädiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
